	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: POWER (SLUSE81F)\n1. Bypass caps as close as possible, REFHP most critical (10.1.2, p.205).\n2. Ground groups per table; islands on L1, join on L2 (10.1.1, Fig. 10-1,\n   p.203-204). NEG5V -> CVSS per 10.1.1 (Fig. 8-1 shows AVSS; same net).\n3. Q1 DPAK: >= 4 cm2 VCOLL copper on L1+L4, stitched; away from U1 and\n   R_CB. R20/R21 share dissipation (8.2.1.2.2, Fig. 8-3, p.193).\n4. Thermal pad: PAP0064F land pattern, vias tented/plugged\n   (pkg drawing notes 8-9, p.220)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 81.28 0)
		(size 40.64 34.2268)
		(margins 2.25 2.25 2.25 2.25)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 255 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 255 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "219e4732-1062-4f4e-b16d-65f901e75815")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nCVDD LOAD BUDGET  (SLUSE81F §7.3.1.5 p.23, Table 7-34)\r\n Ext load max : 10 mA ACTIVE/SLEEP, 5 mA SHUTDOWN (ILIM 35 mA min)\r\n RX tie       : ~0 mA (input leakage)\r\n LED + 2k0    : ~1.5 mA  (only via JP1)\r\n TOTAL        : 1.5 mA of 10 mA -> OK\r\n Daisy comm (~10 mA broadcast) is internal, not in ext budget.\r\n NO other loads on CVDD. Temp sensors = TSREF, balancing = cells.\r\n SHUTDOWN: CVDD not regulated, follows LDOIN (3.4-5.5 V) for WAKE.\r\n   IC draws 16-23 uA; LED would draw ~1 mA -> JP1 OPEN in car."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 120.4004 0)
		(size 60.96 29.4596)
		(margins 2 2 2 2)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "69bb9657-4b7f-48c2-956b-b09d118a27f6")
	)
	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE:\nU1 GROUNDING (TI SLUSE81F §10.1.1)\n\nAll grounds are one net (GND) in the schematic. In layout, each\nbypass cap returns to its own ground pin through a small L1\ncopper island. Islands join the L2 GND plane through vias only.\nDo NOT connect islands to each other on L1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 48.374 0)
		(size 40.64 27.826)
		(margins 2.25 2.25 2.25 2.25)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 255 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 255 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "76c4bba6-b608-48dc-8f50-802988076017")
	)
	(text_box "[${#}] ${TITLE}"
